  "label": "User projected onto the woman's shocked expression",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman displaying an exaggerated shocked expression, which is used to represent the emotional reaction to the absurd statement in the text. The meme implies that the viewer (user) is the one who should be surprised or shocked by the folkloric and biological contrast presented, thus projecting the user's perspective onto the woman's facial reaction.",
